| Priority | Rule | Count |
|---|---|---|
| 1st (accept) | `iifname "br0.10" meta l4proto icmp ip saddr 10.1.0.0/24 ip daddr 10.3.0.0/24 → ACCEPT` | 4 pkts (dswa1) / 0 (dswa2) |
